OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and occasional rain dying
OL,6,Fout during the early morning. The
OL,7,Fafternoon will then be mainly dry with
OL,8,Fsunny spells, just the chance of the
OL,9,Fodd light shower across the Trossachs.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening with
OL,12,Fsome sunshine. The rest of the night
OL,13,Fwill then remain dry for most with
OL,14,Flengthy clear spells and light winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA mainly dry, bright day with
OL,17,Fplenty of warm sunny spells. Sunshine
OL,18,Fwill turn a little hazy at times
OL,19,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
